{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6806", "steam": "sn6806", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「我罪该万死！让我赔礼道歉吧小樱！\\n　不才纱凪，让你宝贝的哥哥失贞了……」", "steam": "“没有错！我要向你道歉小樱乃！我把你重要的哥哥毁了……”"}, "length": {"chs": 38, "steam": 28}, "similarity": 0.423}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6807", "steam": "sn6807", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「小樱，小樱呀！\\n　至少，至少见我一面！让我直接道歉吧！」", "steam": "“小樱乃、小樱乃！至少让我看到你！让我当面道歉！”"}, "length": {"chs": 30, "steam": 25}, "similarity": 0.571}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「纱凪，纱凪，我们先冷静一下好吗？」", "steam": "“纱凪、纱凪，你先冷静下来吧。”"}, "length": {"chs": 18, "steam": 16}, "similarity": 0.64}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我把手伸向在樱乃房门前连续磕头的纱凪，\\n抚上她的肩膀，轻轻安抚她。", "steam": "纱凪对着樱乃的房间门下跪，我看不下去地拍拍她的肩膀安抚她。"}, "length": {"chs": 34, "steam": 29}, "similarity": 0.517}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "……哎呀，呃。\\n在一起睡觉当然是会在一张床上醒来。", "steam": "……昨晚我们一起入睡，然后早晨一起醒来。"}, "length": {"chs": 26, "steam": 20}, "similarity": 0.378}
